15:28:36 INFO     harness.decomposition_review — [decomposition_review] AC STORY-002.AC-2 rewritten:
    was: Non-leap February 29 default resolution
    now: A February 29 birthday is returned as February 28 when the target year is not a leap year and the default policy is applied.
